        "name": "Job Search",
        "summary": "Job pipeline, 1 row per opening. Kanban grouped by `status` (Lead → To Apply → Applied → Interview → Offer → Rejected/Closed). Fit sub-scores: skillsScore/expScore/cultureScore/careerScore (0-100) + locationPass (Pass/Fail/Flag); `score` = roll-up; `tier` = strong/worth/skip. AUTOMATION: dragging a row into the `To Apply` column fires `apply-on-move-to-apply` (pupa/automations.json) → runs /apply-job for that row behind a confirm bubble (never auto-submits). Also chat-invocable: `apply to <job>` / `/apply-job <job>`. apply-job scaffolds job-applications/applications/<slug>/ (cv.md, cover-letter.md, job.md, notes.md via doc-writer subagent) + per-app checklist linked to row, then Playwright submit (pauses for confirm). /job-search fans out job-scout subagents per source bucket. Deadlines calendar auto-fills from `closing` dates. Rubric+profile: search-profile.md."
      }
